 description: >-
   Re-evaluates the gate chain and dispatches an instance revision or a projected
   use-case. Humans and automation use this same path. Instance revisions and
-  their audit records share a transaction. Projected owners commit their effect
+  their audit records share a transaction. Canonical projected owners commit their effect
   and immutable command receipt before the separate canonical success audit;
   an audit failure can therefore return 500 after a confirmed owner effect.
   Completion uncertainty returns 503 with error.code completion_unknown when
   the owner can report it. A request timeout (408), disconnect, or lost response
